:Namespace Evaluation
    ⍝ Hand-crafted evaluation

    ⎕IO ⎕ML←1

    evaluate←{
        ⍝ Evaluate a given postion.
        ⍝ ⍵ ←→ bitboards, game_state
        ⍝ ← ←→ score

        (bitboards game_state)←⍵

        ⍝ The evaluation is symmetric, so a positive score is always good for white
        ⍝ and a negative score is always good for black.
        sign←1-2×game_state[##.GameState.side]

        ⍝ Create weight vector in order of rows of bitboards
        weights←12⍴0
        weights[##.Pieces.(P N B R Q K)]←100 320 330 500 900 0
        weights[##.Pieces.(p n b r q k)]←-weights[##.Pieces.(P N B R Q K)]
        score←+/weights×+/bitboards
        score×sign
    }
:EndNamespace